<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Home on Iorca Blog</title><link>https://iorca.cc/</link><description>Recent content in Home on Iorca Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 10 Apr 2021 20:35:18 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://iorca.cc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>解密Android格式化为内部存储的损坏的SD卡</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%AF%86android%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%E7%9A%84sd%E5%8D%A1/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Apr 2021 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%AF%86android%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%E7%9A%84sd%E5%8D%A1/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;解密格式化为内部存储的损坏的SD卡&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;当SD卡被Android手机格式化为内部存储后如何恢复数据&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;前提：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;1.手机已经root&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;2.手机未重置刷机等，保证 key 还在&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chrome 全屏看视频闪屏 黑屏</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/chrome-%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%8F%E7%9C%8B%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E9%97%AA%E5%B1%8F-%E9%BB%91%E5%B1%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2020 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/chrome-%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%8F%E7%9C%8B%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E9%97%AA%E5%B1%8F-%E9%BB%91%E5%B1%8F/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="最近发现使用chrome浏览器看视频的时候-切换到全屏模式后-屏幕会闪烁一下-google之后找到了几个解决办法操作如下"&gt;最近发现使用chrome浏览器看视频的时候, 切换到全屏模式后, 屏幕会闪烁一下, Google之后找到了几个解决办法,操作如下:&lt;a href="#%e6%9c%80%e8%bf%91%e5%8f%91%e7%8e%b0%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8chrome%e6%b5%8f%e8%a7%88%e5%99%a8%e7%9c%8b%e8%a7%86%e9%a2%91%e7%9a%84%e6%97%b6%e5%80%99-%e5%88%87%e6%8d%a2%e5%88%b0%e5%85%a8%e5%b1%8f%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8f%e5%90%8e-%e5%b1%8f%e5%b9%95%e4%bc%9a%e9%97%aa%e7%83%81%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%8b-google%e4%b9%8b%e5%90%8e%e6%89%be%e5%88%b0%e4%ba%86%e5%87%a0%e4%b8%aa%e8%a7%a3%e5%86%b3%e5%8a%9e%e6%b3%95%e6%93%8d%e4%bd%9c%e5%a6%82%e4%b8%8b" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h5 id="1-关闭硬件加速"&gt;1. 关闭硬件加速&lt;a href="#1-%e5%85%b3%e9%97%ad%e7%a1%ac%e4%bb%b6%e5%8a%a0%e9%80%9f" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;如图所示:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2020-一文搞懂GoogleVoice</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/2020-%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E6%90%9E%E6%87%82googlevoice/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Mar 2020 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/2020-%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E6%90%9E%E6%87%82googlevoice/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://voice.google.com/"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;Google Voice&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt; 是由Google推出的VOIP服务，能够将个人所用的众多电话号码集中成为一个号码，同时提供许多加值服务，它在美加地区提供的免费语音通话和短信服务。该服务由Google于2009年3月11日收购GrandCentral后推出[1]，并且从2009年6月开始邀请一些志愿者参与实验。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ssh remote rsa login</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/ssh-remote-rsa-login/</link><pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2019 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/ssh-remote-rsa-login/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="为了vps的安全以及远程连接方便设置成使用ssh-key免密码登录"&gt;为了VPS的安全以及远程连接方便，设置成使用SSH Key免密码登录&lt;a href="#%e4%b8%ba%e4%ba%86vps%e7%9a%84%e5%ae%89%e5%85%a8%e4%bb%a5%e5%8f%8a%e8%bf%9c%e7%a8%8b%e8%bf%9e%e6%8e%a5%e6%96%b9%e4%be%bf%e8%ae%be%e7%bd%ae%e6%88%90%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8ssh-key%e5%85%8d%e5%af%86%e7%a0%81%e7%99%bb%e5%bd%95" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h4 id="1生成rsa密钥对"&gt;1.生成RSA密钥对&lt;a href="#1%e7%94%9f%e6%88%90rsa%e5%af%86%e9%92%a5%e5%af%b9" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;用SSH连接远程服务器后，执行下面命令：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>How to use Hugo and Github Create Static Blog</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/how-to-use-hugo-and-github-create-static-blog/</link><pubDate>Sat, 04 May 2019 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/how-to-use-hugo-and-github-create-static-blog/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="hugo--github-搭建静态博客"&gt;Hugo &amp;amp; Github 搭建静态博客&lt;a href="#hugo--github-%e6%90%ad%e5%bb%ba%e9%9d%99%e6%80%81%e5%8d%9a%e5%ae%a2" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;操作前提： 1.安装Hugo 2.安装git及后续&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>如何使用 Github 同步 Visual Studio 2017-2019 项目</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8-github-%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5-visual-studio-2017-2019-%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Apr 2019 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8-github-%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5-visual-studio-2017-2019-%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;操作前提：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;1.已安装VS2017或者VS2019&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;2.已安装Git&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;好了，下面开始。首先右键点击项目，注意是在【解决方案”项目名称“】上面右键点击&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://iorca.cc/images/post/vs2019/visual-studio-2019-01.jpg"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://iorca.cc/images/post/vs2019/visual-studio-2019-01.jpg"&#10; alt="1"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://iorca.cc/images/post/vs2019/visual-studio-2019-01.jpg"&#10; data-gallery-alt="1"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>U盘无法复制文件, 报错 0x80071AC3</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/u%E7%9B%98%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99-0x80071ac3/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 Mar 2019 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/u%E7%9B%98%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99-0x80071ac3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;不知道什么原因，我的U盘插入Win7系统时无法复制文件，并弹出如下提示：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&#10; class="image-figure not-prose my-8"&#10; data-lightbox-enabled="&#10; true&#10; "&#10; data-gallery-type="auto"&#10; data-image-width="0"&#10; data-image-height="0"&#10; data-image-src="https://iorca.cc/images/post/u-pan/u-pan-error-01.jpg"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="image-container"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://iorca.cc/images/post/u-pan/u-pan-error-01.jpg"&#10; alt="post1-001.png"&#10; &#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; data-gallery-src="https://iorca.cc/images/post/u-pan/u-pan-error-01.jpg"&#10; data-gallery-alt="post1-001.png"&#10; data-gallery-title=""&#10; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;根据提示，以管理员权限执行chkdsk系统自带的磁盘工具修复即可，比如我的U盘盘符是: F，按照下图修复一下即可：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Bandwagon host vps 搬瓦工</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/bandwagon-host-vps-%E6%90%AC%E7%93%A6%E5%B7%A5/</link><pubDate>Sat, 11 Aug 2018 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/bandwagon-host-vps-%E6%90%AC%E7%93%A6%E5%B7%A5/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="bandwagonhost-简单介绍"&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://bwh88.net/aff.php?aff=36898"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;BandwagonHost&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt; 简单介绍&lt;a href="#bandwagonhost-%e7%ae%80%e5%8d%95%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;svg class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"&gt;&lt;path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/&gt;&lt;path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;因其官网网站标识是BandwagonHost，有点类似BanWaGong的拼写，所以我们喜欢称作为搬瓦工。搬瓦工VPS是一款性价比比较高的便宜VPS主机，且适合入门级网友学习Linux和建站用途.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SONY XZP 刷机</title><link>https://iorca.cc/posts/sony-xzp-%E5%88%B7%E6%9C%BA/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Oct 2017 20:35:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iorca.cc/posts/sony-xzp-%E5%88%B7%E6%9C%BA/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;六月首发入XZP，手痒8.0，刷之。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;折腾步骤：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;1.驱动支持 源地址：http://www.flashtool.net/downloads_windows.php&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>